{"seq":6,"slug":"role-career-paths","title":"各角色成长与晋升路线","docCount":7,"url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering","title":"字节跳动技术工程师的成长路线","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/engineering","wordCount":4160,"readingTime":17},{"seq":2,"slug":"engineering-levels","title":"技术工程师职级逐级详解","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/engineering-levels","wordCount":3537,"readingTime":15},{"seq":3,"slug":"product-manager","title":"字节跳动产品经理的成长路线","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/product-manager","wordCount":1882,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"字节跳动运营岗位的成长路线","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/operations","wordCount":1719,"readingTime":7},{"seq":5,"slug":"design","title":"字节跳动设计师的成长路线","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/design","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7},{"seq":6,"slug":"sales-and-commercialization","title":"字节跳动商业化与销售的成长路线","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/sales-and-commercialization","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7},{"seq":7,"slug":"general-career-advice","title":"字节跳动通用晋升策略与跨角色发展","url":"/h/corporate-management/bytedance/role-career-paths/general-career-advice","wordCount":2095,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 各角色成长与晋升路线\n\n本章按角色分别讲解在字节跳动的职业发展路径、晋升策略与学习方向。\n\n## 本章内容\n\n- **技术工程师** — 前端/后端/算法/架构等方向的L1-L10成长路线\n- **产品经理** — 从初级PM到产品负责人的完整路径\n- **运营岗位** — 内容/用户/活动/商业化/国际化运营发展\n- **设计师** — UX/UI/品牌等设计序列的晋升阶梯\n- **商业化与销售** — 广告销售到商业产品的成长路线\n- **通用晋升策略** — 跨角色通用的影响力积累与转岗机制\n\n## 学习建议\n\n先找到自己所在的角色章节深入学习，再阅读通用策略章节获取跨角色视角。每篇末尾的推荐学习资源可直接作为行动清单。\n"}